      <label>One Line Summary</label>
      <input type="text" class="form-control" name="summary" value="&lt;p&gt; Developed a VR spatial audio training game tested on 35 students (aged 13–17) in rural India, achieving sound localization within 22–41 cm, with over 98% volume-based spatial accuracy and JND of 1–5 dB, providing new routes to accessible navigation for ~4× higher prevalence PVI populations in developing countries. &lt;/p&gt;" required>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary mt-2">Update Summary</button>
    </form>
  </div>

